#list .uploadThumb{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;flex:0 0 44px;width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid rgba(128,134,144,.20);border-radius:16px;background:transparent;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer}
#list .uploadThumb input{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;width:100%;height:100%;cursor:pointer}
#list .uploadPlus{font-size:28px;line-height:1;color:#8b929d;font-weight:400}
#list .preview{position:absolute!important;inset:0!important;margin:0!important;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;padding:0!important;background:transparent!important;border:0!important;border-radius:15px!important;display:none;box-sizing:border-box}
#list .preview img{width:100%!important;height:100%!important;max-height:none!important;object-fit:contain;padding:0!important;border-radius:0!important}
#list .uploadText{min-width:0;flex:1}
#list .title{padding-right:0!important;margin:0!important;font-size:12.5px!important;line-height:1.4!important;font-weight:600!important;min-height:0!important}
#list .uploadHint{font-size:11px;color:#8b929d;margin-top:4px}
#list .card{position:relative!important}
+#list .removeIcon{position:absolute!important;right:5px!important;top:5px!important;width:20px!important;height:20px!important;min-width:20px!important;font-size:15px!important;line-height:20px!important}
+#list .card:has(.removeIcon) .uploadText{padding-top:8px}
#ruleList{gap:16px!important}
#ruleList .ruleCard{display:block!important;padding:16px!important;border-radius:24px!important}
#ruleList .ruleGroupHead{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding-bottom:10px}
#ruleList .ruleGroupHead h2{font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;margin:0;font-weight:650;color:inherit}
#ruleList .ruleGroupHead>span{flex-shrink:0;font-size:12px;color:#8b929d;line-height:24px}
#ruleList .ruleRow{padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(128,134,144,.16)}
#ruleList .ruleName{font-size:14px!important;font-weight:500!important;line-height:1.4}
#ruleList .ruleFile{font-size:11px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin-top:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal!important;color:#8b929d}
.searchEmpty{font-size:14px;color:#8b929d;text-align:center;padding:24px}
</style>
<style id="theme-and-layout-build18">
body{padding-bottom:max(20px,calc(100svh - var(--native-tab-top,calc(100svh - 90px)) + 12px))!important}
.app{padding-bottom:0!important}
body.nav-settings #settingsTarget{min-height:0!important;padding-bottom:0!important}
#settingsCredits{margin-top:20px!important;padding-top:12px!important}
.settingsFold:not([open])>.settingsFoldBody{display:none!important}
body.nav-settings ::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;width:0;height:0}
:root[data-appearance] body.native-card-glass #homeTools,#homeTools{background:rgba(var(--card-rgb,255,255,255),var(--tool-opacity,1))!important}
.themeSliderRow{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:8px;padding:10px 0}
.themeSliderLine{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.themeSliderLine input{flex:1;min-width:0;height:32px;accent-color:#007AFE}
.themeSliderLine output{min-width:42px;text-align:right;font-size:12px;color:inherit}
.themeSwitch{flex:0 0 auto;accent-color:#34c759}.luiyoGlassBtn{background:rgba(255,255,255,.45)!important;-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(180%)!important;backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(180%)!important;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6)!important;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.08)!important}
.settingsFoldBody{overflow:hidden}
.settingsFold:not([open]) .settingsFoldBody{display:none!important}
html.has-background-image,html.has-background-image body{background:transparent!important}
</style><style id="current-version-alignment-v106">
:root[data-appearance] body *, :root[data-appearance] body *::before, :root[data-appearance] body *::after{box-shadow:none!important;text-shadow:none!important}
:root[data-appearance] .settingsFold summary,:root[data-appearance] .settingsAuthHeading{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1fr) 14px!important;gap:9px!important;align-items:center!important;min-height:44px!important;padding:6px 12px!important;box-sizing:border-box}
:root[data-appearance] .luiyoActivationEntry{padding:0!important}
:root[data-appearance] .luiyoActivationForm{margin:8px 12px 12px!important}
:root[data-appearance] .settingsFoldIcon,:root[data-appearance] .settingsToggleIcon{width:28px!important;height:28px!important;display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;font-size:20px!important;line-height:1!important;background:transparent!important}
:root[data-appearance] body.native-symbol-icons .settingsFoldIcon,:root[data-appearance] body.native-symbol-icons .settingsToggleIcon{color:transparent!important}
:root[data-appearance] .settingsFoldText{display:flex!important;flex-direction:column!important;justify-content:center!important;min-width:0}
:root[data-appearance] .settingsFoldText b{font-size:13px!important;line-height:1.2!important;margin:0!important}
:root[data-appearance] .settingsFoldText small{font-size:9.5px!important;line-height:1.25!important;margin:2px 0 0!important}
:root[data-appearance] .inlineVersionTitle,:root[data-appearance] .logTitle{display:flex!important;align-items:baseline!important;gap:8px!important}
:root[data-appearance] .inlineVersionTitle span,:root[data-appearance] .logTitle span{margin:0!important}
body.custom-font-active :is(button,input,summary,span,b,p,small,label,select,textarea){font-family:inherit!important}
</style>
<style id="native-material-content-only-build30">
/* WebKit provides text and input targets. UIKit supplies every card material. */
html.native-material-host[data-appearance],html.native-material-host[data-appearance] body{background:transparent!important;background-image:none!important}
:root[data-appearance] body.native-card-glass :is(.luiyoActivationEntry,.ruleCard,.settingsFold,.settingsFoldBody,.inlineVersion,.guideCard,.logCard,.ruleSearch,.categorytabs,#materialModePicker,#appearanceModePicker,#bottomSearchModePicker){background:transparent!important;background-image:none!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none!important;backdrop-filter:none!important}
</style><style id="compact-clean-controls-build34">
.themeRow[hidden]{display:none!important}
#ruleList .ruleRow,#ruleList .ruleGroupHead{border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important}
</style>
<style id="v106-selection-refinement">
#ruleList .ruleRow{padding:5px 0!important}
#ruleList .ruleGroupHead{padding-bottom:5px!important}
#ruleList .ruleFile{margin-top:2px!important}
#settingsTarget .themeColor button,#settingsTarget .themeFontControls button{background:#fff!important;color:#202832!important}
.themeColor input[type=color]{border:1px solid rgba(110,115,125,.35)!important;border-radius:50%;box-sizing:border-box}
</style><style id="day-night-switch-v106">
input[type=checkbox]{appearance:none!important;-webkit-appearance:none!important;width:44px!important;height:26px!important;flex-shrink:0;position:relative;cursor:pointer;margin:0;background:transparent!important;border:0!important;border-radius:0!important;overflow:visible}
input[type=checkbox]::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:3px;width:44px;height:20px;border:1px solid #85bac9;border-radius:10px;background:#363d61;box-sizing:border-box}
input[type=checkbox]::after{content:"☾";position:absolute;left:2px;top:4px;width:18px;height:18px;border:1px solid #d9bd61;border-radius:50%;background:#7582b8;color:white;text-align:center;font:12px/16px system-ui;box-sizing:border-box;transition:transform .15s ease}
input[type=checkbox]:checked::before{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,white 0 65%,transparent 70%) 14px 9px/13px 7px no-repeat,#a6e0f0}
input[type=checkbox]:checked::after{content:"";background:#ffde63;transform:translateX(22px)}
input[type=checkbox]:checked{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,white 0 65%,transparent 70%) 14px 12px/13px 7px no-repeat!important}
input[type=checkbox]:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #007afe;outline-offset:3px}
</style><style>body.native-day-night-switches input[type=checkbox]{opacity:0!important}</style><style id="luiyo-wallpaper-layout-auth-hotfix">
/* <!-- LUIYo wallpaper/layout + settings auth surface hotfix -->
   Keep image-card rows content-driven after background changes and avoid the
   old fixed/implicit grid row sizing that can let labels collide. */
#list,.grid,.categorytabs,.tools,.dashboard{min-width:0}
#list,.grid{align-content:start;grid-auto-rows:max-content;align-items:stretch}
.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))!important;gap:10px!important}
.grid>.card{position:relative!important;display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:54px minmax(0,1fr)!important;grid-template-rows:minmax(32px,auto) auto!important;align-content:start!important;align-items:center!important;height:auto!important;min-height:78px!important;overflow:hidden!important}
.grid>.card .title{min-width:0!important;min-height:32px!important;height:auto!important;white-space:normal!important;overflow-wrap:anywhere!important}
.grid>.card .pick,.grid>.card .preview{grid-row:1 / span 2!important;align-self:center!important}
.grid>.card:after{grid-column:2!important;grid-row:2!important;align-self:start!important;min-width:0!important;pointer-events:none!important}
#homeTarget,#homeTools,#list,.settingsTarget,#settingsTarget{min-width:0}
body{padding-bottom:calc(112px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))!important}
#list{padding-bottom:calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))!important}
@media(max-width:390px){.grid>.card{grid-template-columns:46px minmax(0,1fr)!important;min-height:74px!important}.grid>.card .pick,.grid>.card .preview{width:46px!important;height:46px!important}}
/* Native iOS renders the real glass. Keep the injected authorization entry
   readable and neutral instead of inheriting an opaque dark hero surface. */
body.native-card-glass #luiyoActivationCard{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.24)!important;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.62)!important;
  color:var(--text,#202832)!important;
  border-radius:26px!important;
}
:root[data-appearance="dark"] body.native-card-glass #luiyoActivationCard{
  background:rgba(44,44,46,.26)!important;
  border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.14)!important;
  color:#f5f5f7!important;
}
</style>
<style id="v107-real-upload-card-wallpaper-fix">
/* v107: renderList() creates .uploadThumb + .uploadText, not .pick/.preview
   as direct children. Keep these real elements in a stable two-column row. */
#list.grid{
  display:grid!important;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))!important;
  grid-auto-rows:max-content!important;
  align-content:start!important;
  align-items:stretch!important;
  gap:10px!important;
}
#list.grid>.card{
  box-sizing:border-box!important;
  display:flex!important;
  flex-direction:row!important;
  flex-wrap:nowrap!important;
  align-items:center!important;
  justify-content:flex-start!important;
  gap:9px!important;
  width:auto!important;
  min-width:0!important;
  min-height:78px!important;
  height:auto!important;
  max-height:none!important;
  padding:10px!important;
  margin:0!important;
  position:relative!important;
  overflow:hidden!important;
  align-self:stretch!important;
}
#list.grid>.card>.uploadThumb{
  box-sizing:border-box!important;
  display:flex!important;
  flex:0 0 48px!important;
  width:48px!important;
  min-width:48px!important;
  height:48px!important;
  min-height:48px!important;
  margin:0!important;
  align-self:center!important;
  position:relative!important;
  overflow:hidden!important;
}
#list.grid>.card>.uploadText{
  display:block!important;
  flex:1 1 0!important;
  width:auto!important;
  min-width:0!important;
  max-width:100%!important;
  margin:0!important;
  padding:0 12px 0 0!important;
  overflow:hidden!important;
  align-self:center!important;
}
#list.grid>.card>.uploadText>.title{
  display:block!important;
  width:auto!important;
  min-width:0!important;
  min-height:0!important;
  height:auto!important;
  margin:0!important;
  padding:0!important;
  line-height:1.35!important;
  white-space:normal!important;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere!important;
  word-break:normal!important;
}
#list.grid>.card>.uploadText>.uploadHint{
  display:block!important;
  min-width:0!important;
  height:auto!important;
  margin:4px 0 0!important;
  line-height:1.35!important;
  white-space:normal!important;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere!important;
}
#list.grid>.card>.removeIcon{
  position:absolute!important;
  top:4px!important;
  right:4px!important;
  z-index:5!important;
}
@media(max-width:390px){
  #list.grid>.card{gap:7px!important;padding:8px!important;min-height:72px!important}
  #list.grid>.card>.uploadThumb{flex-basis:42px!important;width:42px!important;min-width:42px!important;height:42px!important;min-height:42px!important}
  #list.grid>.card>.uploadText{padding-right:10px!important}
}
html.has-background-image #webBackgroundImage{z-index:0!important;pointer-events:none!important}
html.has-background-image body>.app{position:relative!important;z-index:1!important;isolation:isolate}
html.has-background-image body>.appBottomNav{position:fixed!important;z-index:80!important}
</style>
</head><body><div class="app"><section class="homeHero" id="homeTarget">
  <div class="homeEyebrow">LIQUIDUI ICON STUDIO</div>
  <h1>微信图标生成器</h1>
  <div class="homeSub">上传一次，自动处理 LiquidUI / 微信图标补全与打包。</div>
  <div class="homeSummary">
    <div class="homePill" id="count"></div>
    <div class="homePill" id="liveImported">当前上传项目：0 项</div>
  </div>
  <a class="homeFeedback" href="https://qm.qq.com/q/th1QshgzHW" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">反馈问题 · 联系客服</a>
  <input class="search" id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="搜索：转账、位置、底栏微信…">
</section><section class="tools" id="homeTools"><div class="actions"><label class="batch">关键词批量导入<input id="batchInput" type="file" accept="image/*" multiple></label><label class="fillpick">补全图片<input id="fillInput" type="file" accept="image/*"></label><button class="fill" id="fillBtn">双分类补全</button></div><button type="button" class="colorfold" id="colorFoldBtn" aria-expanded="false"><span>自定义修改颜色 <small>浅色 / 深色 / 全部图标</small></span><span class="chev">⌄</span></button><div class="colorpanel" id="colorPanel"><div class="colorrow disabled" id="selectedLightRow"><div><span>自定义选中浅色模式</span><small>默认自动加深；启用后使用这个颜色</small></div><div class="colorcontrols"><label class="switchlabel"><input id="selectedLightEnabled" type="checkbox">启用</label><input id="selectedColor" type="color" value="#1677ff"></div></div><div class="colorrow disabled" id="selectedDarkRow"><div><span>自定义选中深色模式</span><small>默认自动反转；启用后使用这个颜色</small></div><div class="colorcontrols"><label class="switchlabel"><input id="selectedDarkEnabled" type="checkbox">启用</label><input id="selectedDarkColor" type="color" value="#ffffff"></div></div><div class="colorrow disabled" id="allColorRow"><div><span>自定义全部图标颜色</span><small>默认保持上传图片原本颜色</small></div><div class="colorcontrols"><label class="switchlabel"><input id="allColorEnabled" type="checkbox">启用</label><input id="allColor" type="color" value="#222222"></div></div></div><div class="exportrow"><button class="clear" onclick="clearAll()">清空</button><button class="zip" onclick="makeZip(this)">导出 ZIP</button></div><div class="status" id="status">已上传 0 项</div></section><section class="settingsTarget" id="settingsTarget">
  <div class="settingsHead"><h1>设置</h1><p>主题、使用说明与更新日志</p></div>

  <details class="settingsFold themeFold">
    <summary aria-label="主题"><span class="settingsFoldIcon" data-system-icon="circle.lefthalf.filled">◐</span><span class="settingsFoldText"><b>主题</b><small>卡片材质、背景、按钮与字体</small></span><span class="settingsFoldChevron"></span></summary>
    <div class="settingsFoldBody themeBody">
      <div class="themeRow appearanceThemeRow"><div><b>外观模式</b><small id="appearanceHint">跟随系统</small></div><div id="appearanceModePicker" class="appearanceModePicker" role="radiogroup" aria-label="外观模式"><button type="button" data-appearance-mode="system">跟随系统</button><button type="button" data-appearance-mode="light">浅色</button><button type="button" data-appearance-mode="dark">深色</button></div></div>
      <div class="themeRow materialThemeRow"><div><b>卡片材质</b><small id="cardMaterialHint">iOS 26+ 原生液态玻璃 / UIKit 原生磨砂</small></div><div class="materialModePicker" id="materialModePicker" role="radiogroup" aria-label="卡片材质"><button type="button" data-material="liquid">液态玻璃</button><button type="button" data-material="blur">原生磨砂</button></div></div>
      <div class="themeRow"><div><b>背景颜色</b><small id="backgroundHint">浅色背景</small></div><div class="themeColor"><input id="appBackgroundColor" type="color" value="#F4F2EE"><button type="button" id="resetBackgroundColor">恢复</button></div></div>
      <div class="themeRow"><div><b>卡片颜色</b><small>仅修改激活授权上方的品牌卡</small></div><div class="themeColor"><input id="appCardColor" type="color" value="#FFFFFF"><button type="button" id="resetCardColor">恢复</button></div></div>
      <div class="themeRow" hidden><div><b>按钮颜色</b><small>首页工具按钮与上传图标；选中保持白色，清空、导出 ZIP 颜色固定</small></div><div class="themeColor"><input id="appButtonColor" type="color" value="#FFFFFF"><button type="button" id="resetButtonColor">恢复</button></div></div>
      <div class="themeRow appearanceThemeRow bottomSearchThemeRow"><div><b>底栏搜索按钮</b><small id="bottomSearchModeHint">关闭后使用顶部搜索框</small></div><div id="bottomSearchModePicker" role="radiogroup" aria-label="底栏搜索按钮"><button type="button" data-bottom-search-mode="off">关闭</button><button type="button" data-bottom-search-mode="merged">合并</button><button type="button" data-bottom-search-mode="separate">分开</button></div></div>
      <div class="themeRow themeSliderRow" hidden><div><b>工具栏卡片透明度</b><small>仅调整首页工具栏卡片，不影响文字和按钮</small></div><div class="themeSliderLine"><input id="toolbarTransparency" aria-label="工具栏卡片透明度" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="0"><output id="toolbarTransparencyValue">0%</output></div></div>
      <div class="themeRow"><div><b>滚动时缩小底栏</b><small>向下滚动缩小，向上滚动恢复</small></div><input id="minimizeBottomBar" aria-label="滚动时缩小底栏" class="themeSwitch" type="checkbox" switch role="switch"></div>
      <div class="themeRow themeFontRow"><div><b>自定义字体</b><small id="customFontName">使用默认字体</small></div><div class="themeFontControls"><button type="button" id="chooseCustomFont" class="luiyoGlassBtn">导入字体</button><button type="button" id="resetCustomFont">恢复</button><input id="customFontFile" type="file" accept=".ttf,.otf,.woff,.woff2,font/ttf,font/otf,font/woff,font/woff2" hidden></div></div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="settingsFold">
    <summary><span class="settingsFoldIcon" data-system-icon="questionmark.circle">?</span><span class="settingsFoldText"><b>使用说明</b><small>查看功能说明与操作方法</small></span><span class="settingsFoldChevron"></span></summary>
    <div class="settingsFoldBody guideInline">
      <h3>这个工具有什么用？</h3>
      <p>用于快速制作 LiquidUI / 微信图标替换包。只需按网页标题上传图片，管理器会自动处理对应命名、同名同步、补全、颜色和 ZIP 打包，不需要自己逐个查内部文件名。</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>关键词批量导入：</b>图片文件名使用网页标题中的关键词即可模糊匹配，模糊关键词至少 3 个字，两个字请使用完整标题。</li>
        <li><b>双分类补全：</b>用一张补全图片同时填充 LiquidUI 与原版微信中还没有图片的项目。</li>
        <li><b>自动联动：</b>同一图标对应多个内部命名时，上传一次即可在导出时自动生成相关文件。</li>
        <li><b>颜色修改：</b>可分别设置浅色选中、深色选中和全部图标颜色；不开启时保留默认处理。</li>
        <li><b>排除图标：</b>补全后不想更换的项目可以点卡片上的删除按钮，该项目不会进入本次 ZIP。</li>
        <li><b>导出：</b>生成 ZIP 后可改名，再通过 iPhone 系统分享菜单保存或分享。导出的 ZIP 解压后，把全部图片放进「文件」App → 微信 → LiquidUI/Icons 根目录（不带 @3x 的那组图也放这里），再到 LiquidUI 设置 → 全局换图标点「重新扫描图片文件夹」或重启微信。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="settingsFold">
    <summary><span class="settingsFoldIcon" data-system-icon="clock.arrow.circlepath">↻</span><span class="settingsFoldText"><b>更新日志</b><small>Version 1.0.6 · 当前版本</small></span><span class="settingsFoldChevron"></span></summary>
    <div class="settingsFoldBody changelogInline">
<section class="inlineVersion"><div class="inlineVersionTitle">Version 1.0.6 <span>当前版本</span></div><p><b class="add">新增</b> 支持图标上传、关键词批量导入、双分类补全与 ZIP 导出。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 首页、规则与设置采用系统原生玻璃，低版本自动使用原生磨砂；缩小工具栏文字与规则条目间距。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 原版微信与 LiquidUI 分类及导入入口互换，默认显示原版微信；统一反馈与客服联系入口图标。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 移除分类描边、规则分割线及多余阴影；卡片颜色仅作用于授权上方的品牌卡，统一开关样式。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 修复导入图片删除、补全导出、主题字体保存及底栏搜索布局切换。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 优化底栏切换响应，恢复悬浮底栏与首页安全区，保持设置展开状态。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 插件信息与更新日志支持定位展开，再次点击收起。</p></section>
<section class="inlineVersion"><div class="inlineVersionTitle">Version 1.0.5</div><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 修复已知问题。</p><p>该版本为首发测试。</p></section>
<section class="inlineVersion"><div class="inlineVersionTitle">Version 1.0.4</div><p><b class="add">新增</b> 主题支持工具栏卡片透明度、滚动缩小底栏及自定义背景图片；设置自动保存。</p><p><b class="add">新增</b> 底栏搜索改为关闭、合并、分开三段切换，保留已保存的搜索布局；关闭后恢复顶部搜索框。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 相同或相近用途的图标合并为一个上传入口，共用图标归原版微信；LiquidUI 分类保留专属入口，导出保留全部对应文件名。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 首页上传项每排两列，左图右标题；LiquidUI 与原版微信的导入项和规则分组标题统一缩小；更新规则按大标题合并展示。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 导出 ZIP 改名使用系统原生弹窗。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 补全图片和自定义颜色入口略微加粗描边，增加柔和淡色底。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 首页工具卡片改用纯色，其他卡片保持原生材质。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 清空固定蓝色、白色文字；导出 ZIP 固定绿色、白色文字。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 首页分类和设置切换同步配色：未选中底色跟随卡片颜色，选中底色跟随按钮颜色。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 合并和分开底栏搜索均可点击，打开原生全屏搜索页，自动弹出键盘，关闭后返回原页面。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 深色液态玻璃下六个按钮不明显，按钮保持独立纯色并自动适配文字颜色。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 原生底栏文字跟随导入字体，恢复默认和重新打开也同步生效。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 分开搜索改用系统原生独立搜索标签，底栏与搜索统一对齐、尺寸及安全区位置。</p></section>
<section class="inlineVersion"><div class="inlineVersionTitle">Version 1.0.3</div><p><b class="add">新增</b> 主题增加按钮颜色，首页按钮与分类底色同步；浅色、深色分别保存。</p><p><b class="add">新增</b> 跟随系统、浅色与深色外观；背景颜色分别保存并随外观切换。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 搜索框位于反馈问题下方，随材质切换为液态玻璃或原生磨砂。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 首页六个操作按钮保持纯色，其他卡片保留原有材质。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 分类未选中底色使用按钮颜色，增加透明度以呈现柔和层次。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 分类、材质与外观使用紧凑原生分段控件；缩短设置卡片。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 移除自定义卡片描边，鸣谢仅在设置页随内容排布。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 展开动画结束时的高度跳动和重复点击状态。</p></section>
<section class="inlineVersion"><div class="inlineVersionTitle">Version 1.0.2</div><p><b class="add">新增</b> 卡片液态效果开关；关闭后切换为 UIKit 原生磨砂效果。</p><p><b class="add">新增</b> 主题内自定义字体，可导入 TTF、OTF、WOFF、WOFF2 文件并持久保存。</p><p><b class="add">新增</b> 卡片材质、液态玻璃、原生磨砂两种模式直接切换/低于26+不生效液态玻璃。</p><p><b class="add">新增</b> 主题增加卡片颜色，可修改纯色卡片颜色</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 规则页移除图片导入入口，仅显示规则名称与图标规则名。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 首页采用新的双列卡片UI，上传区工具区与顶部信息重新布局。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 设置页入口卡片进一步压缩高度与文字尺寸。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 首页白色工具控件、搜索框、颜色展开项、清空按钮、分类未选中项和上传框统一接入 UIKit 原生玻璃/磨砂材质。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 材质切换与首页分类分段切换改为参考图的胶囊式，选中项使用内嵌白色圆角块。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 首页按钮、搜索框、颜色入口与导出操作统一为分类栏同类圆润胶囊轮廓。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 纯色模式下首页操作框统一为同一中性底色，补全图片、自定义颜色、清空等入口保持清晰可见。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 设置页使用说明与更新日志改为原位下拉拉伸卡片。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 规则页顶部安全区与状态栏重叠问题。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 首页、规则、设置三页卡片视觉统一，首页工具卡不再使用单独的透明样式。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 使用说明、更新日志与主题卡片收起响应延迟，收起动画改为快速响应。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 纯色模式默认不显示卡片描边；只有主动开启卡片描边后才显示所选描边颜色。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 背景颜色现在同步到 UIKit 根视图，修改后立即生效并保存。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 首页双分类切换中间露出的白色材质块；分类容器不再重复叠加玻璃。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 液态玻璃与原生磨砂在刷新、筛选和重绘时原生材质层重新绑定导致的跳动。</p></section>
<section class="inlineVersion"><div class="inlineVersionTitle">Version 1.0.1</div><p><b class="add">新增</b> 全局换图标规则页，可按规则名称与图标规则名查找。</p><p><b class="add">新增</b> 关键词批量导入、双分类补全、同名项目自动联动与 ZIP 自定义名称分享。</p><p><b class="add">新增</b> 浅色选中、深色选中及全部图标颜色自定义。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 设置页的使用说明与更新日志改为原位下拉拉伸，不再弹出独立页面。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> iOS 26+ 使用 UIKit 系统原生 Liquid Glass；不使用 CSS 自绘玻璃。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> iOS 25 及以下自动回退 UIKit 原生 systemMaterial 磨砂。</p><p><b class="opt">优化</b> 规则页移除图片导入入口，只保留规则名称与图标规则名。</p><p><b class="fix">修复</b> 规则页安全区，避免标题与状态栏重叠。</p><